        "text": "The reference class and base rate are short-horizon forecasts of this noisy NSA CPS occupation level. March-June 2026 declined 12.214 to 12.127 to 12.120 to 12.010 million, while June remained 0.391 million above June 2025. Persistence therefore deserves more weight than extrapolating the latest decline. A separate July-specific seasonal prior was not established from the cited observations."
